menu "P4 capture diagnostics"

config P4_CAPTURE_PROFILE
    bool "Measure CPU headroom during a 60-second capture"
    default n
    select FREERTOS_GENERATE_RUN_TIME_STATS
    help
        Development-only CPU and memory measurements. Selects 60/65-second
        run/deadline timing; pair with Feather ads127-p4-capture-60s firmware.
        Samples runtime counters about once per second, prints after capture.
        Leave disabled for the normal 30-minute build. Use a separate sdkconfig
        so FreeRTOS runtime-counter overhead also stays out of normal builds.

endmenu
